    WS -->|"queries session and artifact state via"| ST
    AU -.->|"no-op in v1 (local only)"| WS
    SM -->|"spawns, sends input to"| RA
    RA -->|"streams events to"| SM
    RA -->|"spawns with stream-json, NDJSON pipes"| CLI
    CLI -->|"writes and reads files in"| HFS
    AW -->|"watches outputs dirs on"| HFS
